58..136 Comment "//! Integer and loop-word presentations have equal paths with equal endpoints."
137..198 Comment "//! The source compares folds whose arms use these set paths."
199..202 Comment "//!"
203..259 Comment "//! The checker compares the endpoints of each rule arm."
260..305 Comment "//! The kernel re-derives each resulting law."
